  __syncthreads();
  // Stage weights coalesced as column-major B (co x k), zero-padding k >= 27.
  // sX is dead once sA is built, so sW overlays it (dead-buffer reuse):
  // this shrinks the per-block shared-memory footprint and lifts occupancy.
